          <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>The beta is available on the Kobo Libra Colour, Clara Colour, and Clara BW running the 6.0+ firmware branch. Older devices including the Kobo Libra 2, Sage, and Elipsa have not been confirmed for the beta rollout.</p>
            </div>
